# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build context for admin-panel/Dockerfile (the Next.js admin image).
# node_modules is reinstalled inside the `deps` stage and .next is rebuilt in the
# `builder` stage, so copying the local (host) copies in via `COPY . .` only
# wastes space and risks shipping stale/platform-wrong artifacts.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets & environment ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.local.example

# ── Version control ──
.git
.gitignore

# ── Node dependencies (reinstalled in the deps stage) ──
node_modules/

# ── Next.js build output & caches (rebuilt in the builder stage) ──
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ── Logs & editor/OS cruft ──
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
